    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Em Online",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109805121116157987322/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWd2z7L44m5472lGTQCkIhxSHrdUTfz3W-432VeF09fAn5ODauj=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Its Em with the Lancer ;)\n\nIts time i write a review on them! Ive had my car for 3 years, and they've taken care of my metal baby on wheel for 3 years and counting! Unless I move far away, these guys are my garage! Fully transparent, not afraid to show prices, parts, or bring you to the back to show you anything! They don't extort their prices and know how to be fair. Much love love guys 🫡🤠",
        "time": 1758714436,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tom V",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106233064005371075394/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIKHKJhJ5kiXVa0HzDlT0JpehGgL28e8E60lnzuD9mGZgBzxw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Never returning here again, I suggest you do the same. Dishonest, over priced and VERY immature owners. I brought my car in for a simple issue, next thing they call me to say my car is ready,  but they had never called with an estimate, first. Turns out they did a bunch of work that I did not approve, nor was I expecting.\n\nWhen I attempted to speak with the owner, she was EXTREMELY rude, and then she gets her son to come speak with me and oh boy oh boy. This guy looks like a criminal and acts like one too. I don’t mind tattoos, but between his tattoos and designer brands he was wearing as he was heading out the door, you can tell right away that there’s just too much money flowing through this place.\n\nThey both had this smug look on their faces as they knew my only choice was to pay the bill if I wanted my car back.\n\nI will look into legal repercussions but it may not be worth my time and they probably know it too.\n\nJust keep your hard earned money and stay away from this place.  I wish I had read more of the negative reviews first, they all check out.",
        "time": 1759834680,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Greg Charbonneau",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109603624563600141623/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUDAwR0q-AuLcPQKhjcfmxBe9QOFO4OTnbP1410pIqcnfvTFnuE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I've been a loyal customer of this fantastic local garage for over a decade, and I can't recommend them enough! The team is always professional, offering a clear quote before starting any work and confirming everything by phone. Their service is top-notch, and you can always count on them to be honest and transparent. On top of that, they offer loaner cars, which has been a huge help during repairs. Friendly, reliable, and always go above and beyond. Truly a gem in the community!",
        "time": 1742927893,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Real Estate Drone Photography",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102758583638767635910/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW_iCOo8m2Ie9TCnpwou5YR8qoBkiIv0qYO7ddabQxGPC6n_aD7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Excellent service! Fair pricing, reliable and hard-working staff! I’ve been coming to this place for years and they never let me down. Highly recommended!!",
        "time": 1720617497,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Parker English",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113643035876564111460/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJrkcyEmHDXZ1D7OIleafNiq2OWw5IUOgg8hwp9cxXH8h_rFw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Terrible communication and customer service, I will never be returning and recommend you never come to this shop either.\nI brought my car in for an alternator change, they identified that my remote starter was also causing the issues, but they ran out of time to fix the issue so my car needs to be kept overnight. The next day I hear absolutely nothing from them, I had to call the shop myself 15 min before closing and ask whats happening with my car?? They tell me they couldn't figure it out and need the car ANOTHER day. I get the call two days after I dropped my car off at this point, That everything is fixed and ready for me to pick it up. I arrive and am given my keys back after I pay, only to find in my car the remote starter on the floor. I go back in and they tell me that that is the only thing they can do. I also have to find out myself that none of my key fobs work any more since they took that out. NONE of this was explained to me before I picked up my car, and when I talked to the manager/boss he was very unhelpful and told me to deal with it.\nA couple days later I find that my headlights and high beams no longer work since I brought my car in and they worked on the electrical. I call the shop to try and get this fixed and was called back with a rude condescending, and confrontational manager/boss. They made it very clear they did not care, or want to help me in any way so now I must go to a different shop to get my car fixed.\nI hope nobody ever has to go through what I did and get your car back in worse condition that you dropped it off in. Please don't give them any of your money.",
        "time": 1736954628,
        "translated": false
      }
